---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL; // e.g. "/emoria/"
---

<Base lang="en" title="About us — EMORIA" current="About us"
  description="The founder of EMORIA has gathered more than ten years of experience across a range of social and educational fields.">
  <article class="bg-[var(--color-cream)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-14 pt-36 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-brand)]">✦ About us</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl sm:text-6xl">About us</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-3xl items-start gap-10 px-6 pb-24 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr]">
      <img src={`${base}img/yubuu-headshot.png`} alt="Yubuu" loading="lazy"
        class="mx-auto h-40 w-auto drop-shadow-[0_16px_26px_rgba(43,42,40,0.16)] sm:h-52" />
      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">
        <p>The founder of EMORIA has gathered more than ten years of experience across a range of social and educational fields: in integration kindergartens, schools including special-needs schools, intensive residential groups, counselling services and youth and family welfare.</p>
        <p>From all of these experiences, one thing became ever clearer: feelings shape our lives and our decisions far more than we are often aware. They influence how we approach others, how we handle conflict and how we understand ourselves. And yet many adults themselves learned to talk about them only late, or never. That is a gap that is often passed on unnoticed to the next generation.</p>
        <p>That is exactly why it mattered to the founder that children and young people learn early to recognise their feelings and to talk about them. Every child should have the chance, within the education system, to get to know their feelings and to be allowed to talk about them, regardless of which setting they grow up in. If children do not learn it in kindergarten, at school or at home, where else?</p>
        <p class="italic text-[var(--color-ink)]">EMORIA grew out of this conviction.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 pb-20 text-center">
      <a href={`${base}en/ueber-emoria`} class="font-[var(--font-body)] font-semibold text-[var(--color-brand)] hover:text-[var(--color-brand-deep)]">More about EMORIA →</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
